---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { gallerySrcset, heroSrcset } from '../../utils/images';
---

<Layout
  title="Restaurants | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Two tables worth travelling for. Built around what is in season, what is local, and what is honest."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg"
  hideBookingBar={true}
>
  <Nav theme="both" ctaText="Book my Table" ctaAction="zenchef" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="rst-hero">
      <div class="rst-hero-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg" srcset={heroSrcset('/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg')} sizes="100vw" width="4032" height="3024" alt="Dining at Toile Blanche" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="rst-hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rst-hero-content">
        <p class="rst-hero-eyebrow">The Kitchen</p>
        <h1>Two Tables Worth<br />Travelling For</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TAGLINE -->
    <section class="rst-tagline">
      <div class="rst-tagline-inner">
        <p>Built around what is in season, what is local, and what is honest. The herb garden is twenty metres from the kitchen.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE TWO VENUES -->
    <section class="rst-venues">
      <div class="rst-venues-inner">

        <!-- Le Restaurant -->
        <div class="rst-venue">
          <a href="/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-image">
            <img src="/assets/images/page-img-14433f29c9500d.jpg" alt="Le Restaurant de Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <div class="rst-venue-content">
            <h2><a href="/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-title-link">Le Restaurant</a></h2>
            <p class="rst-venue-tagline">The evening version: more considered, more intimate, the kitchen at full attention.</p>
            <p class="rst-venue-desc">Le Restaurant is a love letter to the Côte d'Azur. A space where the Mediterranean tradition is reimagined through a contemporary lens. Open year-round for dinner.</p>
            <div class="rst-venue-actions">
              <button type="button" data-zc-action="open" class="rst-venue-btn">Reserve a Table</button>
              <a href="/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-link">Discover Le Restaurant &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- La Guinguette -->
        <div class="rst-venue">
          <a href="/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-image">
            <img src="/assets/images/page-img-7f72d09199a7a2.jpg" alt="La Guinguette de Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <div class="rst-venue-content">
            <h2><a href="/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-title-link">La Guinguette</a></h2>
            <p class="rst-venue-tagline">Lunch under the plane trees — rosé, grilled fish, the specific joy of eating outside in Provence.</p>
            <p class="rst-venue-desc">Open from May to October, La Guinguette is the heart of the garden. Come barefoot or in espadrilles. The South will sweep your worries away — if you had any to begin with.</p>
            <div class="rst-venue-actions">
              <button type="button" data-zc-action="open" class="rst-venue-btn">Reserve a Table</button>
              <a href="/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-link">Discover La Guinguette &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- BREAKFAST -->
    <section class="rst-breakfast">
      <div class="rst-breakfast-inner">
        <a href="/breakfast" class="rst-breakfast-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/4f3bf84f-fd91-4f40-84eb-dc95844afcda.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/breakfast/4f3bf84f-fd91-4f40-84eb-dc95844afcda.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1170" height="1422" alt="Breakfast at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <div class="rst-breakfast-content">
          <p class="rst-breakfast-eyebrow">Every Morning</p>
          <h2><a href="/breakfast" class="rst-venue-title-link">Le Petit-Déjeuner</a></h2>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-tagline">Coffee, croissants, and the sound of the garden waking up. One of the things guests remember most.</p>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-desc">Fresh bread from a local bakery. Seasonal fruit. Eggs as you like them. Local honey, jams, and cheeses. Orange juice pressed that morning. Served in the breakfast room, on the terrace, or delivered to your suite.</p>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-hours">Served daily, 8:00 – 10:30</p>
          <a href="/breakfast" class="rst-venue-link">More about breakfast &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="rst-philosophy">
      <div class="rst-philosophy-inner">
        <h2>The wine list is a love letter to the region. The tomatoes arrived this morning.</h2>
        <p>Our menus are built around the rhythm of the seasons. We work with local producers who share our obsession with material integrity. Staying at Toile Blanche means entering a conversation with the landscape — first through the art, then through the table.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="rst-cta">
      <p>The table is set.</p>
      <button type="button" data-zc-action="open" class="rst-cta-btn">Reserve a Table</button>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

